          "ruleIndex": 26,
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "Payment API authenticates to Token store with a static credential Replace the static secret with a workload identity: mutual TLS between services, or a short-lived token minted per connection. Where the datastore cannot do that, at least sink the password into a vault and rotate it on a schedule the team can prove."
